OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA cloudy
OL,6,Fevening with the odd sunny spell
OL,7,Finitially. A band of light rain
OL,8,Farriving through the late evening and
OL,9,Fcrossing the region overnight.
OL,10,Fclearing to isolated showers around
OL,11,Fdawn. Breezy initially but winds
OL,12,Feasing overnight. Feeling less mild.
OL,13,
OL,14,CWednesday:FA cloudy start with showers
OL,15,Fclearing to leave a mostly dry
OL,16,Fmorning. Showers develop through the
OL,17,Fafternoon, potentially turning heavy
OL,18,Fwith risk of hail and thunder. Light
OL,19,Fwinds freshening later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
